# Paint (OpenFL)

Simple painting. Keys **1–9** pick the colour (1 black, 2 red, 3 green,
4 blue, 5 yellow, 6 magenta, 7 cyan, 8 orange, 9 white). This is the
OpenFL counterpart of `live-examples/paint.wcn`: the WCHNT schema and
painting logic match; the Target section adapts input and drawing to OpenFL.

The brush holds a `Colour` enum; the palette maps colours to packed ARGB
`Int`s. Conversion to Int happens only at draw time. Target only reads
platform input, injects it, steps, and asks WCHNT to paint.

## Schema

```
Paint = Canvas :Brush Palette Inbox
Canvas = Int/width Int/height
Brush = Int/x Int/y Int/rad Colour Bool/painting
Colour = "Black" | "White" | "Red" | "Green" | "Blue" | "Yellow" | "Cyan" | "Magenta" | "Orange"
Palette = {Colour:Int}
>Inbox = Int/mouseX Int/mouseY Bool/down [String]/keys
```

## Construction

```
[:Paint
  [:Canvas 800 600]
  [:Brush 0 0 5 Black false]
  [:Palette
    {Colour:Int
      Black:   0xFF000000
      White:   0xFFFFFFFF
      Red:     0xFFFF0000
      Green:   0xFF00FF00
      Blue:    0xFF0000FF
      Yellow:  0xFFFFFF00
      Magenta: 0xFFFF00FF
      Cyan:    0xFF00FFFF
      Orange:  0xFFFF8000
    }
  ]
  [:Inbox 0 0 false [:Array/String]]
]
```

## Methods

```
Paint::step = {
  nextColour = inbox.keys.fold(brush.colour, { current, key | palette.colourForKey(current, key)}).
  nextBrush = [:Brush inbox.mouseX inbox.mouseY brush.rad nextColour inbox.down].
  [:Paint canvas nextBrush palette inbox]
}

Inbox::update! = { [:Inbox mouseX mouseY down keys] }

Palette::colourForKey = { Colour/current, String/key |
  switch (key)
    "1" -> { Black }
    "2" -> { Red }
    "3" -> { Green }
    "4" -> { Blue }
    "5" -> { Yellow }
    "6" -> { Magenta }
    "7" -> { Cyan }
    "8" -> { Orange }
    "9" -> { White }
    else -> { current }
}

Brush::paint = { @WCHNTGraphics/g |
  col = thePaint.palette.colourToInt.get(colour).
  if (painting) {
    g.beginFill(col).drawCircle(x, y, rad).endFill()
  } else { g }
}

Canvas::paint = { @WCHNTGraphics/g |
  g.beginFill(0xFFFFFFFF).drawRect(0, 0, width, height).endFill()
}
```

## Target

```
%openfl

%init
var paint:Paint;

function init():Void {
    paint = PaintAssemblage.factory();
    paint.canvas.paint(wchntGraphics);
}

%step
function step():Void {
    paint.inbox.inject(wchntInput.mouseX(), wchntInput.mouseY(), wchntInput.mouseDown(), wchntInput.keyPresses());
    paint = paint.step();
    paint.brush.paint(wchntGraphics);
}
```
